{"seq":44,"slug":"engineering-onboarding-enablement","title":"工程师入职与赋能","stage":"DONE","category":"management","chapterCount":4,"docCount":12,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/management/engineering-onboarding-enablement","rating":{"composite":4.18,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":3.8,"coverage":3.5,"positioning":5,"strategic":4.67},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":null},"introHtml":"<h1 id=\"工程师入职与赋能\">工程师入职与赋能</h1><p>工程团队花费数月招到合适的人，却在入职的第一周让新人困在坏掉的开发环境里挣扎——这个失败模式在行业中反复上演。Gallup 研究显示仅 12% 的员工认为自己经历了出色的入职体验，而 Brandon Hall Group 的数据表明结构化入职能将新人留存率提升 82%、生产力提升超过 70%。入职不是 HR 流程的附属品，它是工程团队对人才投资回报率的直接放大器。</p>\n<p>本 hub 覆盖从 offer 签署到新人独立产出的完整链路，以及所有工程师持续赋能的基础设施。内容围绕四个维度展开：项目设计（如何搭建入职框架）、学习路径（如何系统传递知识）、度量与反馈（如何知道入职是否有效）、赋能基建（如何让所有工程师持续高效）。</p>\n<p><strong>与相邻 hub 的分工边界：</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"../engineering-management/\">engineering-management</a> 覆盖团队建设、绩效管理、日常 1:1 等管理者通用职责；本 hub 聚焦入职这一特定时间窗口的流程设计与赋能基础设施</li>\n<li><a href=\"../career-advancement/\">career-advancement</a> 关注个人职业发展路径、晋升策略与影响力积累；本 hub 关注的是组织如何帮助新人快速达到产出基线</li>\n<li><a href=\"../mentoring-teaching-growth/\">mentoring-teaching-growth</a> 深入探讨导师能力的培养与教学方法论；本 hub 只涉及导师体系在入职场景中的具体实施</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>推荐学习路径：</strong></p>\n<ol>\n<li>先读「项目设计」章节理解入职框架全貌</li>\n<li>再读「学习路径」了解知识传递的具体手段</li>\n<li>然后读「度量」章节学会衡量入职效果</li>\n<li>最后读「赋能」章节建立持续支撑工程师的基础设施</li>\n</ol>\n<p><strong>前置知识：</strong> 具备基本的工程团队运作经验（了解 sprint、code review、CI/CD 等概念），对人员管理有初步认知即可。</p>\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"program-design","title":"入职项目设计","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/management/engineering-onboarding-enablement/program-design","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"onboarding-framework","title":"入职框架与 30-60-90 计划","url":"/l-doc-books/h/management/engineering-onboarding-enablement/program-design/onboarding-framework"},{"seq":2,"slug":"codebase-ramp-up","title":"代码库快速上手","url":"/l-doc-books/h/management/engineering-onboarding-enablement/program-design/codebase-ramp-up"},{"seq":3,"slug":"culture-values-alignment","title":"文化与价值观融入","url":"/l-doc-books/h/management/engineering-onboarding-enablement/program-design/culture-values-alignment"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"learning-paths","title":"学习路径","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/management/engineering-onboarding-enablement/learning-paths","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"tech-stack-learning","title":"技术栈学习路径","url":"/l-doc-books/h/management/engineering-onboarding-enablement/learning-paths/tech-stack-learning"},{"seq":2,"slug":"domain-knowledge-transfer","title":"领域知识传递","url":"/l-doc-books/h/management/engineering-onboarding-enablement/learning-paths/domain-knowledge-transfer"},{"seq":3,"slug":"mentoring-buddy-system","title":"导师与伙伴体系","url":"/l-doc-books/h/management/engineering-onboarding-enablement/learning-paths/mentoring-buddy-system"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"measurement","title":"度量与改进","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/management/engineering-onboarding-enablement/measurement","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"onboarding-metrics-ttv","title":"入职度量与 Time-to-Value","url":"/l-doc-books/h/management/engineering-onboarding-enablement/measurement/onboarding-metrics-ttv"},{"seq":2,"slug":"feedback-iteration","title":"反馈收集与迭代","url":"/l-doc-books/h/management/engineering-onboarding-enablement/measurement/feedback-iteration"},{"seq":3,"slug":"remote-onboarding","title":"远程入职实践","url":"/l-doc-books/h/management/engineering-onboarding-enablement/measurement/remote-onboarding"}]},{"seq":4,"slug":"enablement","title":"赋能基础设施","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/management/engineering-onboarding-enablement/enablement","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"internal-documentation","title":"内部文档与知识库","url":"/l-doc-books/h/management/engineering-onboarding-enablement/enablement/internal-documentation"},{"seq":2,"slug":"developer-tooling-setup","title":"开发者工具与环境配置","url":"/l-doc-books/h/management/engineering-onboarding-enablement/enablement/developer-tooling-setup"},{"seq":3,"slug":"continuous-learning-culture","title":"持续学习文化","url":"/l-doc-books/h/management/engineering-onboarding-enablement/enablement/continuous-learning-culture"}]}]}